{"id":"00279","root":"uni00279_1","name":{"ja":"NO.16ソニア","en":"No. 16 Sonia"},"title":{"ja":"【C97】","en":"【C97】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【C97】 NO.16ソニア","en":"【C97】 No. 16 Sonia"},"aliases":["NO. 16 Sonia"],"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-12-23","limited":true,"characterId":50,"profile":{"ja":"人魔問わず斬り殺す殺人鬼として、米連国内で恐れられた人物。残虐非道な行いで有名であり、捕まるまでの間に１００人以上の人魔が惨殺された。その手口から、魔族の犯行ではないかと目されていたが、捕まったのは教師として働く女性ソニア。逮捕時には血しぶきを浴びているショッキングな姿が米連中に放映された。すぐに裁判が行われ、死刑になった――ということになっているが、それは表向き。彼女の才能に目をつけた米連の研究者が持ちかけた取引にのり、ソニアは人造人間になって生まれ変わった。見た目や体の構造はほぼ人間のままだが、神経筋骨格系組織が魔族レベルに強化されている。その後は裏の世界に足を踏み入れ、米連に仇なす魔族や人を切り殺している。","en":"No. 16 Sonia is a notorious murderer who slaughters both humans and demons alike, striking fear throughout the Federation. Her brutal, inhumane deeds are infamous; before her capture she had massacred over a hundred humans and demons. Though her methods suggested a demonic perpetrator, she was apprehended as a schoolteacher named Sonia. The shocking image of her drenched in blood at the time of arrest was broadcast across the Federation. A swift trial followed, resulting in a death sentence—at least on the surface. Spotting her talent, Federation researchers offered a deal: Sonia would be reborn as an artificial human. Her appearance and body remain largely human, but her neuro-musculoskeletal system has been reinforced to demon-level strength. Since then she's stepped into the shadows, cutting down demons and humans who threaten the Federation."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"蒼桐かこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00279_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1242,2484],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[183,366],"def":[116,232],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","430001"]},{"id":"uni00279_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1884,3768],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[291,582],"def":[157,314],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["5","430001","430002"